{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.QuantumObservableUniverses.VirtualProjection","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.QuantumObservableUniverses.VirtualProjection","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.BigOperators.Group.Finset.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.BigOperators.Ring.Finset","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Module.Basic"],"declarations":3,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Virtual.pi0_eq_zero_iff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Virtual.pi0_eq_zero_iff","kind":"theorem","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverses/VirtualProjection.lean#L51-L66","doc":"**On-shell survives; off-shell vanishes — exactly.**  Over a domain\nwith no zero smul-divisors, the base-level projection vanishes iff the\nbase state is zero or some dressing form is off-shell.  Equivalently, the\nexcitation is observable (`π_0 ≠ 0`) iff `f ≠ 0` and every form has a\nnonzero constant part. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Virtual.pi0_offshell","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Virtual.pi0_offshell","kind":"theorem","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverses/VirtualProjection.lean#L42-L49","doc":"**Off-shell ⇒ no shadow.**  If some dressing form is off-shell\n(`e i = 0`), the excitation projects to zero at the base level — it is\nnon-observable. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Virtual.pi0","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Virtual.pi0","kind":"def","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverses/VirtualProjection.lean#L38-L40","doc":"The base-level projection of a level-`n` excitation: base state `f`\ndressed by forms with counits `e i` projects to `(∏ i, e i) • f`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}